        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white">Free <span class="text-gradient">VIN Checker</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-silver-400">Decode any Vehicle Identification Number instantly using official NHTSA data</p>
      </div>
      <div class="px-8 py-6">
        <p class="text-silver-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">Car Alpha's VIN checker decodes any 17-character Vehicle Identification Number to reveal complete vehicle specifications, open safety recalls, and ownership intelligence. Our data comes directly from the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA), ensuring accuracy and reliability.</p>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
